{"audio": "1timothy-05.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 168133, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3200, "text": "1 Timothy, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 3200, "end_ms": 12133, "text": "Rebuke not an elder, but intreat him as a father; and the younger men as brethren; The elder women as mothers; the younger as sisters, with all purity."}, {"start_ms": 12133, "end_ms": 14267, "text": "Honour widows that are widows indeed."}, {"start_ms": 14267, "end_ms": 24000, "text": "But if any widow have children or nephews, let them learn first to shew piety at home, and to requite their parents: for that is good and acceptable before God."}, {"start_ms": 24000, "end_ms": 31600, "text": "Now she that is a widow indeed, and desolate, trusteth in God, and continueth in supplications and prayers night and day."}, {"start_ms": 31600, "end_ms": 35200, "text": "But she that liveth in pleasure is dead while she liveth."}, {"start_ms": 35200, "end_ms": 38933, "text": "And these things give in charge, that they may be blameless."}, {"start_ms": 38933, "end_ms": 46933, "text": "But if any provide not for his own, and specially for those of his own house, he hath denied the faith, and is worse than an infidel."}, {"start_ms": 46933, "end_ms": 63200, "text": "Let not a widow be taken into the number under threescore years old, having been the wife of one man, Well reported of for good works; if she have brought up children, if she have lodged strangers, if she have washed the saints' feet, if she have relieved the afflicted,"}, {"start_ms": 63200, "end_ms": 66667, "text": "if she have diligently followed every good work."}, {"start_ms": 66667, "end_ms": 76400, "text": "But the younger widows refuse: for when they have begun to wax wanton against Christ, they will marry; Having damnation, because they have cast off their first faith."}, {"start_ms": 76400, "end_ms": 86400, "text": "And withal they learn to be idle, wandering about from house to house; and not only idle, but tattlers also and busybodies, speaking things which they ought not."}, {"start_ms": 86400, "end_ms": 95200, "text": "I will therefore that the younger women marry, bear children, guide the house, give none occasion to the adversary to speak reproachfully."}, {"start_ms": 95200, "end_ms": 98000, "text": "For some are already turned aside after Satan."}, {"start_ms": 98000, "end_ms": 106267, "text": "If any man or woman that believeth have widows, let them relieve them, and let not the church be charged; that it may relieve them that are widows indeed."}, {"start_ms": 106267, "end_ms": 113733, "text": "Let the elders that rule well be counted worthy of double honour, especially they who labour in the word and doctrine."}, {"start_ms": 113733, "end_ms": 118667, "text": "For the scripture saith, Thou shalt not muzzle the ox that treadeth out the corn."}, {"start_ms": 118667, "end_ms": 122000, "text": "And, The labourer is worthy of his reward."}, {"start_ms": 122000, "end_ms": 126667, "text": "Against an elder receive not an accusation, but before two or three witnesses."}, {"start_ms": 126667, "end_ms": 132000, "text": "Them that sin rebuke before all, that others also may fear."}, {"start_ms": 132000, "end_ms": 141467, "text": "I charge thee before God, and the Lord Jesus Christ, and the elect angels, that thou observe these things without preferring one before another, doing nothing by partiality."}, {"start_ms": 141467, "end_ms": 148000, "text": "Lay hands suddenly on no man, neither be partaker of other men's sins: keep thyself pure."}, {"start_ms": 148000, "end_ms": 154667, "text": "Drink no longer water, but use a little wine for thy stomach's sake and thine often infirmities."}, {"start_ms": 154667, "end_ms": 161067, "text": "Some men's sins are open beforehand, going before to judgment; and some men they follow after."}, {"start_ms": 161067, "end_ms": 168133, "text": "Likewise also the good works of some are manifest beforehand; and they that are otherwise cannot be hid."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 1308, "si": 0}, {"t": "Timothy,", "s": 1308, "e": 1670, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2053, "e": 2435, "si": 0}, {"t": "Five.", "s": 2677, "e": 3099, "si": 0}, {"t": "Rebuke", "s": 3601, "e": 4021, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 4101, "e": 4282, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 4322, "e": 4402, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder,", "s": 4502, "e": 4782, "si": 1}, {"t": "but", "s": 4943, "e": 5063, "si": 1}, {"t": "intreat", "s": 5103, "e": 5443, "si": 1}, {"t": "him", "s": 5483, "e": 5583, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 5624, "e": 5704, "si": 1}, {"t": "a", "s": 5744, "e": 5764, "si": 1}, {"t": "father;", "s": 5844, "e": 6224, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 6805, "e": 6905, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6925, "e": 7006, "si": 1}, {"t": "younger", "s": 7046, "e": 7346, "si": 1}, {"t": "men", "s": 7386, "e": 7546, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 7586, "e": 7687, "si": 1}, {"t": "brethren;", "s": 7747, "e": 8187, "si": 1}, {"t": "The", "s": 8528, "e": 8608, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder", "s": 8688, "e": 8928, "si": 1}, {"t": "women", "s": 8968, "e": 9209, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 9269, "e": 9349, "si": 1}, {"t": "mothers;", "s": 9409, "e": 9810, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 10070, "e": 10150, "si": 1}, {"t": "younger", "s": 10210, "e": 10511, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 10551, "e": 10631, "si": 1}, {"t": "sisters,", "s": 10691, "e": 11152, "si": 1}, {"t": "with", "s": 11272, "e": 11392, "si": 1}, {"t": "all", "s": 11452, "e": 11552, "si": 1}, {"t": "purity.", "s": 11612, "e": 12053, "si": 1}, {"t": "Honour", "s": 12455, "e": 12717, "si": 2}, {"t": "widows", "s": 12797, "e": 13140, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 13180, "e": 13301, "si": 2}, {"t": "are", "s": 13341, "e": 13442, "si": 2}, {"t": "widows", "s": 13482, "e": 13804, "si": 2}, {"t": "indeed.", "s": 13864, "e": 14186, "si": 2}, {"t": "But", "s": 14728, "e": 14828, "si": 3}, {"t": "if", "s": 14868, "e": 14928, "si": 3}, {"t": "any", "s": 14988, "e": 15108, "si": 3}, {"t": "widow", "s": 15208, "e": 15449, "si"